e or altered from their natural state (coins, jewelry, cut or crushed gems, mirrors, etc.), nor can they be taken from someone else's possession.
\par \tab A single }{\i\fs24 conjure spell component}{\fs24  spell will summon three components per level of the caster. They may be three different components or multiples of a single component.
