\par \tab When this spell is cast upon a nonmagical fire (such as a campfire, lantern, or candle), it causes the fire to flash and shoot arrows of flame. All creatures within 10 feet of the fire source suffer 1 
point of damage per level of the caster (maximum of 10 points). Victims who roll a saving throw successfully suffer no damage. 
