 each other. Balfas, however, can "target" a thought so that only one of the two participants receives it.
\par \tab If the priest casts this spell on an unwilling subject (for example, if the priest wants to silently threaten or taunt the subject), the subject receives a saving throw vs. spell to resist the effect. Willing subjects need not make a saving throw.

\par \tab Lead sheeting of more than \'bd " thickness will totally block }{\i\fs24 telepathy}{\fs24 .   
