\par \tab For spells marked with an asterisk (*),  }{\i\fs24 telethaumaturgy}{\fs24  also increases the range of the reversed spell. Unless indicated, }{\i\fs24 telethaumaturgy}{\fs24  does not increase the range of the reversed spells.
