\par \tab This cooperative spell requires at least three priests casting the spell simultaneously. At the time of casting, the priests must be within 10 feet of each other. Upon compl
etion of the spell, the priests sing a single, dissonant chord. The result of the spell depends on the number of voices in the choir. 
