\par 9 to 18 \tab \tab 3 weeks 
\par 19 to 24\tab \tab 2 weeks 
\par 25 to 30\tab \tab 1 week 
\par 31 to 35\tab \tab 3 days 
\par 36 or more\tab \tab 1 day 
\par }\pard \nowidctlpar\tx360\adjustright {\fs24 
\par \tab The effects of this spell can be removed by a }{\i\fs24 limited wish}{\fs24 , }{\i\fs24 wish}{\fs24  (or equally powerful magic), or by a }{\i\fs24 heal}{\fs24  spell cast for this specific purpose.
\par \tab The material component is a small bust of a human head, about 3" in height, made from fine, delicate china. The priest shatters this bust during the casting. 
